OL,3,GNEWSA'My darling girl, you are
OL,4,Aeverything to me' - auctioned letters
OL,5,Areveal WWI love story
OL,6,
OL,7,F"My darling girl, you are everything to
OL,8,Fme..."
OL,10,FThose words were written by Gunner
OL,11,FWillie Webber to his wife Gladys from
OL,12,Fthe battlefields of World War One.
OL,14,FThe newly-weds, who were married at St
OL,15,FEdward's Church in Knighton, Powys, in
OL,16,FDecember 1917, had very little time
OL,17,Ftogether as Willie - a gunner with the
OL,18,FRoyal Garrison Artillery's 297th Siege
OL,19,FBattery - was serving on the Western
OL,20,FFront. He was killed just weeks before
OL,21,Fthe Armistice in 1918.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
