OL,3,GNEWSA'My darling girl, you are
OL,4,Aeverything to me' - auctioned letters
OL,5,Areveal WWI love story
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than a century later, Willie's
OL,8,Fletters have inspired an extraordinary
OL,9,Fact of remembrance by the community -
OL,10,Fthanks to the efforts of two strangers
OL,11,Fwho refused to let the couple's love
OL,12,Fstory be forgotten.
